Subject: [PATCH] Coordinate a sole same-window terminal owner outside the
 direct close workspace

Bind all four owner checks to the actual direct workspace, with independent pre-remove callback capture. Preserve the ordinary single-owner close path and cover live/pending ownership for closed and non-owning open sidebar entries.
